# Vercel applies this file from the repository root to every project built
# from this repo, including candy-beta (Root Directory: web). So web/ must not
# be listed here, or candy-beta's build loses web/package.json. The static
# site keeps web/ private with redirects in vercel.json instead.

# Internal notes and the Flask API source. No page loads anything from these
# paths, and without this Vercel serves them publicly (for example
# /AGENT_WORKLOG.md and /backend/requirements.txt).
/docs
/backend
/AGENT_WORKLOG.md
/REVIEW_NOTES.md
